      - Summary
        - Delivers Iteration 2 of the roadmap: devices and groups management with single‑group assignment, end‑to‑end tests, and frontend UI.
        - Builds on Iteration 1 (auth + users) already in this PR: now a complete owner/admin workflow exists to manage devices and groups.
