          - DELETE /api/groups/{id} — delete group (404 if missing) → {"ok": true}
          - POST /api/groups/{gid}/devices/{did} — assign device (single‑group enforced by replacing mapping)
          - DELETE /api/groups/{gid}/devices/{did} — unassign device
          - NEW: GET /api/groups/{id}/devices — list devices assigned to the group
        - Notes
          - thresholds/modbus_config are stored as JSON strings but expanded in API responses as JSON objects
          - Single‑group assignment is enforced; a second assignment replaces the mapping
      - Frontend UI
        - Devices page
